; atc_pause.ngc - Operator notification hook for manual tool change
;
; Called after the machine has moved to the change position (G30 or home Z)
; but before the operator pause.  The ATC plugin has already reported the
; tool name/comment to the stream if one exists in the tool table.
;
; #4900 = incoming tool number
; #4902 = outgoing carousel pocket (0 if outgoing tool was not in carousel)
;
; Add any operator signalling here (lights, buzzers, etc.)
;

M2
